@goodandready/dsh-goal README · 6. Acceptance Gate & Critic Verification (#163)：* **Plan Mode (Read-Only Planning Phase)**: The agent explores the codebase, searches the web, and decomposes tasks into structured milestones and checklists. All file mutating tools (`write_to_file`, `replace_file_content`, mutating shell commands) are strictly blocked by `lib/tool-guard.js`.
* **Act Mode (Implementation Phase)**: The operator reviews and approves the plan directly via the banner or details modal with «Approve & Execute», unlocking mutating capabilities and resuming the agent.
* **REST API & Quick Launch**: Toggle modes on demand via `POST /dsh-goal/action` (`set_mode`, `approve_plan`), or select initial mode directly in the Quick Launch dialog.

@goodandready/dsh-goal README · Start a goal：curl -X POST http://localhost:3080/dsh-goal/action \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"action":"start","title":"Implement automated backup pipeline"}'

@goodandready/dsh-goal README · Pause：curl -X POST http://localhost:3080/dsh-goal/action \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"action":"pause"}'

@goodandready/dsh-goal README · Resume：curl -X POST http://localhost:3080/dsh-goal/action \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"action":"resume"}'

@goodandready/dsh-goal README · Inspect live state：curl http://localhost:3080/dsh-goal/state
